’s, and Temple College.\n🛒 Essentials: Minutes from Miller Park and H-E-B.\n🍔 Dining: Close to local favorites like Megg’s Café and Texas Roadhouse.\n\n\nVisit our website or call our leasing office today to check current availability and schedule your visit!  📞  (254)742-7733\n\nhttps://spradleyproperties.com/unit-detail/?id=2105&unit=Apt%20165", "channel_id": "UCfS8-4IPB1bN8oN1N2zqsSw", "channel_url": "https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCfS8-4IPB1bN8oN1N2zqsSw", "duration": 29, "view_count": 7, "age_limit": 0, "webpage_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MYkFoAUWeMI", "categories": ["People & Blogs"], "tags": [], "playable_in_embed": true, "live_status": "not_live", "media_type": "video", "_format_sort_fields": ["quality", "res", "fps", "hdr:12", "source", "vcodec", "channels", "acodec", "lang", "proto"], "automatic_captions": {}, "subtitles": {}, "channel": "Spradley Properties", "channel_follower_count": 11, "uploader": "Spradley Properties", "uploader_id": "@spradleyproperties8911", "uploader_url": "https://www.youtube.com/@spradleyproperties8911", "upload_date": "20260506", "timestamp": 1778082889, "availability": "public", "webpage_url_basename": "watch", "webpage_url_domain": "youtube.com", "extractor": "youtube", "extractor_key": "Youtube", "playlist_count": 22, "playlist": "Spradley Properties - Videos", "playlist_id": "UCfS8-4IPB1bN8oN1N2zqsSw", "playlist_title": "Spradley Properties - Videos", "playlist_uploader": "Spradley Properties", "playlist_uploader_id": "@spradleyproperties8911", "playlist_channel": "Spradley Properties", "playlist_channel_id": "UCfS8-4IPB1bN8oN1N2zqsSw", "playlist_webpage_url": "https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCfS8-4IPB1bN8oN1N2zqsSw/videos", "n_entries": 22, "playlist_index": 2, "display_id": "MYkFoAUWeMI", "fulltitle": "Cozy 1x1 at Autumn Chase | Minutes from Baylor Scott & White & Temple College 🏠", "duration_string": "29", "is_live": false, "was_live": false, "epoch": 1784926884, "format": "137 - 1920x1080 (1080p)+251 - aud